# A schematic of Larry's house, north of the Falador fountain, for Mahogany Homes replays. Not the
# real map: the house's outline (Home.LARRY, 3033-3042 by 3360-3368) with its seven pieces of
# furniture set out on one open floor, and Larry inside.
#
# Facts:
#  - the furniture is RuneLite's CON_CONTRACT_FALADOR_NORTH_HOTSPOT1 to _HOTSPOT7
#    (net.runelite.api.gameval.ObjectID), in the order the game's eight hotspot varbits
#    (VarbitID.CON_CONTRACT_HOTSPOT_1_DISPLAY to _8) describe them
#  - Larry is NpcID.CON_CONTRACT_CLIENT_5
#  - the wiki's Larry table: drawers (2 planks each), grandfather clock (1), hat stand (1), two
#    tables (3 each) and a range (1 steel bar); the names below are the pieces' own
#
#   y 3367  drawers2                       clock
#   y 3365        larry
#   y 3362  range   table1      table2     hatStand
#   y 3360  ---------- door 3038 -------------
#        x 3034                           3041

scene 2960 3300

npc CON_CONTRACT_CLIENT_5 "Larry" 3037 3365 as larry

object CON_CONTRACT_FALADOR_NORTH_HOTSPOT1 3034 3362 as range
object CON_CONTRACT_FALADOR_NORTH_HOTSPOT2 3034 3367 as drawers1
object CON_CONTRACT_FALADOR_NORTH_HOTSPOT3 3036 3367 as drawers2
object CON_CONTRACT_FALADOR_NORTH_HOTSPOT4 3036 3362 as table1
object CON_CONTRACT_FALADOR_NORTH_HOTSPOT5 3041 3367 as clock
object CON_CONTRACT_FALADOR_NORTH_HOTSPOT6 3039 3362 as table2
object CON_CONTRACT_FALADOR_NORTH_HOTSPOT7 3041 3362 as hatStand

name CON_CONTRACT_FALADOR_NORTH_HOTSPOT1 "Range"
name CON_CONTRACT_FALADOR_NORTH_HOTSPOT2 "Drawers"
name CON_CONTRACT_FALADOR_NORTH_HOTSPOT3 "Drawers"
name CON_CONTRACT_FALADOR_NORTH_HOTSPOT4 "Table"
name CON_CONTRACT_FALADOR_NORTH_HOTSPOT5 "Grandfather clock"
name CON_CONTRACT_FALADOR_NORTH_HOTSPOT6 "Table"
name CON_CONTRACT_FALADOR_NORTH_HOTSPOT7 "Hat stand"
